cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Scotoma
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
abstract: >-
  Off-target candidate enumeration in sequence a reference genome cannot represent. Given a
  haplotype-resolved assembly, a reference, and a guide panel, Scotoma partitions the assembly's
  SpCas9 target windows into those the reference contains and those it does not, scores both
  against the same panel in a size-matched comparison, and reports the candidate density of each.
type: software
